   "actionTime": "12:35:33",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1781 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5116, H.R. 2751 and H.R. 5142. Providing for consideration of the Senate amendment to H.R. 5116, consideration of the Senate amendments to H.R. 2751, and consideration of the Senate amendment H.R. 2142",
